{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G3-04","example":{"issue":{"title":"鄉區斜交路口的停讓管制與路口位置辨識問題","intro":"主要道路寬約 8 m、速限 50 km/h；次要道路寬約 6 m、速限 30 km/h。周邊多為未開發土地及零散聚落，兩側均未設人行設施。","images":[{"key":"results:g3-04-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"crop":[0,0,2920.072,2424]},{"key":"results:g3-04-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-04-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-04-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-04-photo-4","label":"現況照片 4","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"priority","title":"主次道路先行關係不明確","text":"主要道路與次要道路寬度差異不大，若缺少停讓標誌及標線，駕駛不易判斷應先行或停車。"},{"id":"guidance","title":"斜交路口缺少明確導引","text":"路口為斜交型式，且次要道路兩側車道配置不同，缺少清楚的車行範圍及路口導引。"},{"id":"speed","title":"速限標誌與標字不足","text":"鄉區道路交通量較少，現況缺少完整的速限提示，駕駛不易辨識路段速限。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[83,84],"strategy":{"title":"次要道路槽化、停車再開與橋梁限重預告","intro":"透過次要道路類滴狀島槽化線及停管制，凸顯斜交路口位置，並配合路側空間及前方橋梁限重安排相關設施。","images":[{"key":"results:g3-04-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"channelization","title":"於次要道路設置類滴狀島槽化線","text":"在次要道路接近路口處劃設類滴狀島槽化線，區分對向車流並引導車輛接近路口。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"priority","title":"設置停止線及「停」標字","text":"於次要道路配置停止線與「停」標字，明確標示停車位置；斜交路口的停止線原則上與橫交道路平行。","moduleId":"M2-01"},{"id":"boundaries","title":"以路面邊線界定路肩及轉角空間","text":"於路口劃設路面邊線，並配合轉角槽化線及設計車種轉彎軌跡，界定可行駛範圍。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"bridge","title":"提前預告前方橋梁限重","text":"本例西往東通過路口後即為限重橋梁，於路口上游設置車輛總重限制標誌，搭配「前方橋梁限重」附牌，使超重車輛可提前選擇繞道。","moduleId":"M4-02"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-3-04-unsignalized-rural-skewed-cross.typ","sha256":"045f9fe5624845ad15ed66e980554773ded33346728ac8ee28540c172d9dc811","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g3-04-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-04/G3-04_現況圖_01.png","width":3040,"height":2424,"label":"G3-04 現況圖","scenario":"G3-04","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":83,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image106.png","sha256":"f8238559dc4b079d4bff51ede3797e6804ca6eb17a9ef2ce91fcf77f797a4399"},"results:g3-04-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-04/G3-04_現況照片_01.png","width":2502,"height":1387,"label":"G3-04 現況照片","scenario":"G3-04","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":84,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image109.png","sha256":"160f1b291666e4d0e05bddd5a61f3e48cce825687167eb66f16370931df11bf3"},"results:g3-04-photo-2":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-04/G3-04_現況照片_02.png","width":2490,"height":1422,"label":"G3-04 現況照片 2","scenario":"G3-04","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":84,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image107.png","sha256":"4a97e1bc600b1ed1c7c126cbd3bae510db97a3326894ada2103979c6c7e1aedc"},"results:g3-04-photo-3":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-04/G3-04_現況照片_03.png","width":2509,"height":1368,"label":"G3-04 現況照片 3","scenario":"G3-04","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":84,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image108.png","sha256":"bd061a71a6cbec636d82c5557cbc0caa18a3eb88d0f1dadfc3fd7c3672e70641"},"results:g3-04-photo-4":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-04/G3-04_現況照片_04.png","width":2541,"height":1403,"label":"G3-04 現況照片 4","scenario":"G3-04","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":84,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image110.png","sha256":"f543eaa2b4ded20e96a1285aceb41dc68d37b507010b9048f3615e3b118bec89"},"results:g3-04-strategy":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/G3-04/G3-04_無號誌鄉區斜交四叉路口交通設施整體設置圖例.svg","width":729,"height":674,"label":"G3-04 整體佈設圖","scenario":"G3-04","role":"strategy","sha256":"ac54083ffe073c5480742aec56a2d84b2418b703621f4789982c5d88be376e76"}}}
